  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Please be aware that there will be construction on the property next door, currently estimated to take place from mid-August 2025 through late 2026.<br>During this time, construction vehicles may be parked in front of the front property, Above It All. This should not affect the parking at this property.<br>We appreciate your understanding and want to ensure you’re aware of this in advance. If you have any questions regarding parking or your stay, please don’t hesitate to reach out.<br><br>A Winterpast by the Sea: Gulf Front 30A Home, POOL, Beach Chair Svc INCLUDED!<br><br>This is a new listing for 2025 as A Winterpast is under new management! This is one of two properties that share the same large driveway and can be rented together for large groups. Both homes share the same 130 feet of beach usage (which is PLENTY of space to stretch out and enjoy the water) and stairs down to the beach. If you are interested in A Winterpast's sister listing, Above It All, you can find it by searching the map (subject to availability, of course). <br><br>** Beach Chair Service Included For The 2026 Season (Mar-Oct)! 2 Chairs & An Umbrella!<br>** Beach towels included with every rental! <br><br>Step into a world where coastal charm meets modern luxury at A Winterpast by the Sea, a stunning beach retreat perfectly nestled on the beach along beautiful 30A. This enchanting coastal home is designed to evoke the romance of unforgettable beach vacations while embracing every comfort of today’s lifestyle, creating a vacation experience that is both memorable and effortlessly relaxing.<br><br>Upon arrival, you’ll be greeted by a beautiful space where every detail has been carefully curated. Sunlight pours through large windows that frame views of the emerald green, crystal clear waters of the Gulf Coast. Whether you’re settling into the comfortable living area with its tasteful furnishings or exploring the subtle accents throughout the home, you’ll feel an immediate sense of welcome.<br><br>Gather with family or friends in an open-concept living room with vaulted ceilings designed for both conversation and quiet reflection. Soft, neutral tones paired with coastal-inspired decor create an ambiance that is both soothing and sophisticated.<br><br>The fully equipped kitchen ample counter space and all the culinary essentials you need to create a feast. Enjoy your meals at the elegant dining area or take your breakfast al fresco on the private patio as you listen to the whisper of waves.<br><br>Retreat to tranquil bedrooms where plush bedding and a calming color palette promise restorative nights. Every detail—from the carefully chosen linens to the artwork—ensures your stay is as peaceful as it is luxurious.<br><br>Outdoor Oasis & Prime Location: Step outside into your private slice of paradise. Whether you’re enjoying a morning coffee on the patio overlooking the Gulf, unwinding with a glass of wine as the sun sets, or simply soaking in the natural beauty, the outdoor space is designed to be an extension of your living area. And when you’re ready to explore, you’re just minutes away from the best that the 30A coastline has to offer.<br><br>Imagine days filled with sun, sea, and the timeless magic of the Gulf Coast—a place where every moment is infused with history, beauty, and modern comforts. A Winterpast by the Sea is more than a vacation rental; it’s your personal retreat where you can create lasting memories against a backdrop of endless blue skies and gentle ocean breezes.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 17)<br><br>1st Floor<br>• Bedroom 1: 1 King Bed<br>• Bedroom 2: 1 King Bed<br>• Bedroom 3: 1 King Bed<br>• Bedroom 4: 2 Twin Beds<br><br>2nd Floor<br>• Bedroom 5: 1 Queen Bed, 2 Twin Beds, 1 Twin over Twin Bunk Bed, and 1 Twin over Full Bunk Bed**<br>**Please Note: ALL Top Bunks have a weight limit of 100lbs",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Deeded Beach Access - Last Min June Dates Available! Beach Chairs Included!"
        }
      ],
