          {
            "date": "Nov 8, 2025",
            "id": "3dbc6c31-7a5c-4c70-b44b-a8d03a91c14b",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your kind words! We’re thrilled to hear that the home was spotless and that you found it both charming and perfect for your family’s beach getaway. It’s wonderful to know we helped make your vacation special. We look forward to welcoming you back for another perfect stay soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house was SO clean. It was charming and the most perfect stay at the beach for my family and I to date. Thanks to Blue Swell, the management company that holds this rental. They were excellent with recommendations for everything we needed in this vacation.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Sharon S.",
        "date": "2025-11-16T17:41:59Z",
        "id": "691a1b5071e88759432b973f",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "House has a great layout and perfect for a family. Everyone - all 9 of us- had plenty of space and privacy. Beds were comfy and was so nice each bedroom had its own bathroom! Location on the beach was perfect and was so nice to just walk down early for coffee and the location made it so easy to go back and forth during the day. Pool was nice. Blue Swell was very attentive and happy to answer any questions and attend to any needs before and during our trip. We had a great vacation! I would stay here again!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
