            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for your kind review! We're so happy to hear the house was a great fit for your family vacation and that the location worked perfectly for your group.\n\nWe also appreciate your note about a few areas showing wear — your feedback is valuable, and we'll be sure to assess and make updates where needed to keep the home in top shape.\n\nWe’d love to welcome you and your family back anytime!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This house was great for my family vacation of 12 people. The location was fantastic!! It might need a few updates as some things are showing some wear and tear, but overall it is great!",
