            "id": "48a92e23-f6d0-41ba-8f4a-d9e20e960f8b",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for being a loyal guest and for sharing your honest feedback. We’re so glad the location, layout, and beachside pool continue to make this a great spot for your group. It’s wonderful to hear you’ve noticed improvements like the new bedding and our team’s responsiveness. We appreciate your comments about maintenance and are actively working on updates to ensure the home remains comfortable and inviting. We look forward to welcoming you back again soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We’ve stayed at this property several times, including with the prior property management company. We return because the location is great and layout works wonderfully for our group—particularly the beach side pool. The new property manager is very responsive and helpful. The house itself is definitely needing some love and maintenance, but the new bedding was nice and everything was very clean.",
